WEBVTT

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:35.110
Ah, Lord of Black, who resides 
at the ends of the earth...

00:01:36.530 --> 00:01:42.370
I thank you for bestowing upon 
me a portion of your power.

00:01:49.060 --> 00:01:50.490
At last...

00:01:50.490 --> 00:01:52.600
At last, my dream has come true!

00:01:52.950 --> 00:01:55.590
Pale skin that appears almost transparent...

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:57.980
Vibrant dark patches under my eyes...

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:00.460
Sharp fangs and claws...

00:02:01.390 --> 00:02:04.060
And black wings!

00:02:05.540 --> 00:02:08.600
Now I'm finally one of the Black Brood!

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:10.690
This is the best feeling ever!

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:14.440
Today is going to be a fantastic day!

00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:16.070
Oh, that's right!

00:02:16.070 --> 00:02:18.950
Since I finally have these amazing wings...

00:02:19.210 --> 00:02:20.950
I should go for a stroll!

00:02:30.510 --> 00:02:32.710
This is pretty difficult.

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:40.380
The breeze feels so nice.

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:52.280
Ow...

00:02:53.320 --> 00:02:55.940
I'd better be careful 
until I get used to this.

00:03:04.710 --> 00:03:09.460
I smell something delicious... I think?

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:11.390
Where's it coming from?

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:15.020
Over here?

00:03:21.410 --> 00:03:23.550
What's a door doing here?

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:25.790
Is it some sort of sorcery?

00:03:29.410 --> 00:03:33.020
Oh, this is where the delicious 
smell is coming from!

00:03:46.360 --> 00:03:48.010
Welcome!

00:03:50.860 --> 00:03:54.040
<i>A demon?! This is a demon dwelling?!</i>

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:56.040
No.

00:03:56.040 --> 00:03:58.090
Fighting is not permitted here.

00:04:00.790 --> 00:04:03.670
Wh-What? What was that?!

00:04:04.190 --> 00:04:07.470
U-Um, ma'am, are you all right?

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:10.810
Oh, uh, I'm fine. No problem.

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:14.440
You startled me when you suddenly 
sat on the floor like that.

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:16.970
Thank you.

00:04:17.390 --> 00:04:22.060
Um, I came here through a 
door I found in the forest,

00:04:22.060 --> 00:04:24.070
but what is this place, exactly?

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:26.520
This is Western Restaurant Nekoya.

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:29.580
It's a shop that serves delicious food.

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:31.330
Delicious food?

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:33.900
Would you like to have a 
meal while you're here?

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:36.770
I would! I was so hungry!

00:04:36.770 --> 00:04:38.940
Then please take a seat wherever you'd like.

00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:40.020
Okay!

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:45.350
Oh... Um, I'd like to talk to the 
people sitting over there. Can I?

00:04:45.350 --> 00:04:48.200
You want to sit with them? 
I'll ask if it's all right.

00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:49.790
Please wait here for a moment.

00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:56.960
I asked them.

00:04:56.960 --> 00:04:59.270
They said they don't mind 
if you sit with them.

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:02.260
It seems they'd like to talk to you, too.

00:05:02.260 --> 00:05:04.030
I'll walk you to the table.

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:05.850
Okay. Thank you.

00:05:09.710 --> 00:05:12.540
Um, thank you for letting me sit here.

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:14.610
Hi there. Nice night, isn't it?

00:05:14.920 --> 00:05:17.940
We didn't expect to meet 
one of our own kind here.

00:05:17.940 --> 00:05:19.260
I'm Romero.

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:21.550
My name is Julietta.

00:05:21.550 --> 00:05:24.720
Nice to meet you. I'm Rorona.

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:27.080
I only just became one of the Black Brood,

00:05:27.080 --> 00:05:29.930
so, um... I would appreciate your guidance.

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:32.180
Black Brood?

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:35.590
Oh, never mind.

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:38.140
Aletta, can we add to our order?

00:05:38.140 --> 00:05:38.960
Sure!

00:05:39.670 --> 00:05:43.210
Two each of the roast beef and grape liquor.

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:44.620
What would you like, Rorona?

00:05:44.620 --> 00:05:46.740
Oh, I'll have the same thing.

00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:48.450
Coming right up!

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:50.260
Come sit over here.

00:05:50.260 --> 00:05:51.340
Thanks.

00:05:54.650 --> 00:05:59.590
<i>It looks like Romero has been part of 
the Black Brood for a few centuries.</i>

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:04.330
<i>And Julietta may have just recently joined?</i>

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:08.330
You mentioned the Black Brood a moment ago.

00:06:08.330 --> 00:06:09.380
Yes.

00:06:09.380 --> 00:06:11.720
Where do you live?

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:14.030
Huh? Where?

00:06:14.030 --> 00:06:16.750
In the Lord of Black's capital, of course.

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:20.230
All members of the Black Brood live in the

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:23.620
Lord of Black's capital, except a select few.

00:06:26.090 --> 00:06:28.060
Lord of... Black?

00:06:28.060 --> 00:06:30.700
But you don't mean the Goddess of Darkness?

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:32.560
Goddess of Darkness?

00:06:32.560 --> 00:06:36.540
No, darkness is part of the 
Lord of Black's domain,

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:39.020
but the Lord of Black is 
just the Lord of Black.

00:06:39.020 --> 00:06:40.830
The Goddess of Darkness is different.

00:06:42.600 --> 00:06:46.580
Um... Did I say something funny?

00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:47.840
Oh, no.

00:06:48.150 --> 00:06:52.850
I see. It's possible that she's 
from the Land of Vampires.

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:56.100
Oh! There's a Land of Vampires?

00:06:56.330 --> 00:06:57.270
Yes.

00:06:57.580 --> 00:07:01.600
I heard about it from an elder who 
had lived over a thousand years.

00:07:02.090 --> 00:07:07.600
Long ago, some traveling elves 
discovered a nation of vampires.

00:07:08.170 --> 00:07:11.610
There, vampires reigned as the nobility,

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:14.480
and in exchange for protecting 
the human commoners,

00:07:14.480 --> 00:07:16.500
they took their blood and governed them.

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:22.280
And those acknowledged by the vampires were 
permitted to become vampires themselves.

00:07:22.280 --> 00:07:24.820
That was how they increased their numbers.

00:07:25.760 --> 00:07:28.890
Oddly, the vampires of this nation

00:07:28.890 --> 00:07:32.240
could use immense powers, 
even in the sunlight,

00:07:32.240 --> 00:07:35.350
so even the elves couldn't defeat them.

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:36.810
U-Um...

00:07:37.760 --> 00:07:42.220
Are you calling those of 
the Black Brood "vampires"?

00:07:42.220 --> 00:07:43.900
Yes, that's right.

00:07:44.200 --> 00:07:45.690
I get it now!

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:47.960
Based on the story you just told me,

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:52.650
this Land of Vampires is 
definitely the land I live in.

00:07:53.060 --> 00:07:58.120
Oh? So there really are vampires 
who have conquered the sunlight?

00:07:58.120 --> 00:08:02.870
Yes. High-ranking nobles cover their 
bodies in the Black Dragon's scales

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:05.420
so that they can walk in the sunlight.

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:06.630
Oh...

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:13.230
Still, I never expected to meet a vampire 
in the Restaurant to Another World.

00:08:13.650 --> 00:08:15.090
Another World?

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:17.890
This is a different world?

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:19.890
Yes, it is.

00:08:20.200 --> 00:08:24.190
It's a restaurant that serves 
food from the other world.

00:08:26.060 --> 00:08:27.640
Thank you for waiting.

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:31.400
<i>Roast Beef</i>

00:08:29.580 --> 00:08:31.400
Here's your roast beef.

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:34.060
And here's your grape liquor.

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:35.780
Thank you.

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:37.280
Here we go!

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:41.070
Um, so this half-cooked meat 
is the food they serve?

00:08:41.070 --> 00:08:43.790
Yes. It's absolutely delicious!

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:46.160
It pairs well with the grape liquor.

00:08:46.610 --> 00:08:50.200
The best dish for filling your 
belly is the beefsteak,

00:08:50.200 --> 00:08:52.930
but the one that goes best 
with liquor is roast beef.

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:54.830
I guarantee that it will taste good.

00:08:54.830 --> 00:08:56.260
Here, go ahead.

00:08:56.760 --> 00:08:58.520
A-All right...

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:07.640
<i>These two seem to think this 
half-cooked meat is delicious.</i>

00:09:07.640 --> 00:09:09.940
<i>I hope it doesn't make me sick.</i>

00:09:10.600 --> 00:09:13.580
<i>Then again, I'm not human anymore.</i>

00:09:13.580 --> 00:09:15.150
<i>I'll be just fine!</i>

00:09:19.360 --> 00:09:20.740
It's so tender!

00:09:21.280 --> 00:09:24.450
It's so different from meat 
that's been grilled or stewed!

00:09:24.450 --> 00:09:26.710
Well? Surprised, aren't you?

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:28.590
Yes! It's delicious!

00:09:28.590 --> 00:09:29.710
Isn't it?

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:31.960
It may look like it's simply been cooked,

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:35.160
but it's nothing like any 
of the foods we normally eat.

00:09:35.160 --> 00:09:37.470
That's what's so interesting 
about this place.

00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:40.920
I've never had such delicious meat before!

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:49.240
<i>The more I chew it, the more the 
meat's natural flavors fill my mouth.</i>

00:09:49.720 --> 00:09:52.840
<i>And this sauce made from minced 
oranie is a perfect match!</i>

00:09:55.960 --> 00:09:57.740
What is this?

00:09:58.080 --> 00:10:01.740
That's wasabi, a seasoning 
from the other world.

00:10:01.740 --> 00:10:05.120
It burns a bit, but it makes the 
food you add it to taste better.

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:06.620
Oh...

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:16.130
<i>It's burning my nose!</i>

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:21.390
<i>It burns, but that heat and the aroma 
bring out the flavor of the meat!</i>

00:10:21.910 --> 00:10:25.520
Now, try it with the grape liquor, too.

00:10:25.980 --> 00:10:26.910
Okay!

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:36.400
A nice match, isn't it?

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:39.450
Yes! It brings out the 
savoriness of the meat,

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:42.140
but the fruity flavor still 
has a strong presence.

00:10:42.140 --> 00:10:44.440
They harmonize so well!

00:10:44.440 --> 00:10:46.790
I could keep eating this forever!

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:50.590
Oh... I'm sorry! I got 
so engrossed in eating...

00:10:51.480 --> 00:10:53.060
We don't mind.

00:10:53.060 --> 00:10:55.690
When you run out, we can order more.

00:10:56.030 --> 00:10:57.050
Right, Romero?

00:10:57.050 --> 00:10:58.060
Yes.

00:10:58.060 --> 00:10:59.760
Eat all you like.

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:02.050
It's on us tonight.

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:04.020
A-Are you sure?

00:11:04.370 --> 00:11:08.380
This lovely night has brought us together.
 Let us celebrate it.

00:11:08.380 --> 00:11:09.850
Indeed.

00:11:09.850 --> 00:11:11.520
Thank you!

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:14.020
Now, how about a toast?

00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:19.460
To the darkness of this night 
that brought us together.

00:11:19.460 --> 00:11:20.990
To the darkness of the night.

00:11:24.980 --> 00:11:27.200
Well, shall we eat, too?

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:28.250
Yes.

00:11:37.200 --> 00:11:38.150
Excuse me.

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:39.230
Yes?

00:11:39.230 --> 00:11:43.260
One more roast beef and 
grape liquor for each of us.

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:46.010
And some bread as well, please.

00:11:46.250 --> 00:11:47.760
Understood.

00:11:49.780 --> 00:11:51.770
Is something the matter?

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:56.020
I sense a ton of the Lord of 
Black's power coming from you.

00:11:56.020 --> 00:11:58.280
Are you one of the Brood, too?

00:11:58.280 --> 00:12:00.530
No, I am not.

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:02.490
Oh, you're not?

00:12:02.490 --> 00:12:04.740
I'm sorry for saying 
something so strange, then.

00:12:04.740 --> 00:12:06.530
If you'll excuse me.

00:12:07.850 --> 00:12:10.460
I was sure she was one of my kind.

00:12:10.460 --> 00:12:11.660
Oh, well.

00:12:15.840 --> 00:12:19.300
<i>What a day. I finally joined the Black Brood,</i>

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:22.240
<i>I met Romero and Julietta,</i>

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:25.890
<i>and I got to eat this delicious food.</i>

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:29.690
<i>It's been an even more amazing 
day than I ever imagined.</i>

00:12:29.690 --> 00:12:33.360
<i>I guess I've already received the 
blessing of the Lord of Black!</i>

00:12:39.140 --> 00:12:42.030
Well, see you again in seven days, okay?

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:42.800
Yes.

00:13:10.430 --> 00:13:14.890
Never would've expected to find 
a place like this in the forest.

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:18.050
And what a shock to learn 
that it's in another world.

00:13:18.050 --> 00:13:19.940
Honestly...

00:13:20.260 --> 00:13:22.290
I can't believe you followed me.

00:13:22.290 --> 00:13:24.530
You two have some lousy habits, you know that?

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:26.160
I'm sorry, okay?

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:28.660
We do apologize for that.

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:34.040
But you haven't seemed like 
yourself lately, and we were concerned.

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:35.420
That's right.

00:13:35.420 --> 00:13:37.940
You've only been accepting 
jobs that take you out

00:13:37.940 --> 00:13:41.610
to remote forests for hardly any pay at all.

00:13:44.620 --> 00:13:48.300
Never would've thought it was 
all for some dessert, though.

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:51.810
You two have no idea how 
amazing the desserts here are!

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:53.120
Yeah, yeah.

00:13:53.570 --> 00:13:56.810
So which of these is the 
one you're so stuck on?

00:13:57.220 --> 00:14:00.230
This one. It's called cheesecake.

00:14:00.490 --> 00:14:03.550
Huh... A dessert made with cheese, huh?

00:14:03.550 --> 00:14:06.240
It's incredibly good!

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:10.190
I once bought the dessert said to 
be the best in the imperial capital,

00:14:10.190 --> 00:14:12.130
but I was disappointed.

00:14:12.440 --> 00:14:15.250
The dessert here was many times better.

00:14:15.630 --> 00:14:19.000
Well, that sounds like something 
we can look forward to.

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:25.050
Huh... I don't see what could 
be so amazing about it, though.

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:27.680
You'll eat anything and say it's tasty.

00:14:27.680 --> 00:14:28.510
Huh?

00:14:29.380 --> 00:14:32.530
I see there are three types of this dessert.

00:14:32.530 --> 00:14:34.570
Which one should I order?

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:36.680
I recommend the souffle chee—

00:14:36.680 --> 00:14:38.020
Hey, you there!

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:39.500
C-Coming!

00:14:40.580 --> 00:14:42.270
How can I help you?

00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:47.030
Bring us three of each 
type of this cheesecake.

00:14:47.030 --> 00:14:48.030
Sure!

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:51.340
Oh, Aletta, bring a black 
tea for each of us, too.

00:14:51.340 --> 00:14:52.860
Coming right up!

00:14:53.980 --> 00:14:56.110
Why did you order all of them?

00:14:56.110 --> 00:14:59.680
There are three types. 
Don't you wanna compare them?

00:14:59.680 --> 00:15:02.920
Good point. I've only ever had the souffle.

00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:04.920
This might be a good time.

00:15:05.540 --> 00:15:11.180
For a restaurant, this place sure 
has some interesting characters.

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:14.460
It's a wonder they're not 
trying to kill each other.

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:18.180
Welcome!

00:15:18.670 --> 00:15:19.540
Huh?!

00:15:19.540 --> 00:15:20.410
What is it?

00:15:20.410 --> 00:15:23.690
Th-That's the first prince 
and princess of my homeland.

00:15:23.690 --> 00:15:26.440
Even royalty comes here?

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:29.170
Could that young lady sitting with them be...

00:15:30.060 --> 00:15:31.920
The Princess of the Empire.

00:15:32.470 --> 00:15:33.790
Now it makes sense.

00:15:33.790 --> 00:15:36.100
I had heard that the Land 
of Sand and the Empire

00:15:36.100 --> 00:15:40.060
were working on establishing 
friendly relations.

00:15:40.060 --> 00:15:42.210
So this is what they meant.

00:15:42.210 --> 00:15:44.270
They sure are getting along well.

00:15:44.270 --> 00:15:45.040
Yeah.

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:46.280
Indeed.

00:15:47.400 --> 00:15:49.210
Thank you for waiting.

00:15:49.320 --> 00:15:51.040
<i>Souffle Cheesecake</i>

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:51.040
Here's your souffle cheesecake,

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:52.880
rare cheesecake,

00:15:51.150 --> 00:15:52.880
<i>Rare Cheesecake</i>

00:15:52.880 --> 00:15:54.720
and baked cheesecake.

00:15:52.990 --> 00:15:54.720
<i>Baked Cheesecake</i>

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:58.670
Huh, so this is the dessert 
that Hilda's so hooked on?

00:15:58.670 --> 00:16:01.370
They all look quite different.

00:16:01.370 --> 00:16:03.190
Well, let's dig in!

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:15.820
<i>This stuff really is good!</i>

00:16:16.360 --> 00:16:20.280
<i>The citrus peel mixed into 
it adds a sour, bitter touch</i>

00:16:20.280 --> 00:16:22.520
<i>that goes great with the 
flavor of the cheese.</i>

00:16:23.570 --> 00:16:29.800
<i>The aromatic, browned surface and 
heavy, dense texture are irresistible!</i>

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:32.240
<i>I had no idea the cheese we eat all the time</i>

00:16:32.240 --> 00:16:34.770
<i>could be made into a dessert 
with just a little work.</i>

00:16:34.770 --> 00:16:37.230
<i>This little slice ain't nearly enough!</i>

00:16:40.720 --> 00:16:44.220
<i>Oh? This one hasn't been baked?</i>

00:16:44.220 --> 00:16:47.480
<i>But even royalty eats at this restaurant,</i>

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:50.180
<i>so surely they don't serve anything dodgy.</i>

00:16:53.610 --> 00:16:54.570
<i>Oh!</i>

00:16:55.380 --> 00:16:58.120
<i>Is this really cheese?</i>

00:16:58.120 --> 00:17:00.830
<i>It feels as smooth as silk on my tongue,</i>

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:02.780
<i>but it has a refreshing sourness.</i>

00:17:02.780 --> 00:17:06.140
<i>It's nothing like the cheese I normally eat!</i>

00:17:08.560 --> 00:17:10.900
<i>It lacks the unique odor of cheese.</i>

00:17:10.900 --> 00:17:14.150
<i>It's so fresh, with a strong flavor of milk.</i>

00:17:14.150 --> 00:17:17.700
<i>It reminds me of a drink 
I once had in the mountains.</i>

00:17:21.960 --> 00:17:26.940
<i>This red fruit mixes a slight sourness 
with a sweet flavor and smell.</i>

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:29.430
<i>It's a perfect match for this cheesecake.</i>

00:17:33.770 --> 00:17:37.910
<i>Looks like they're both captivated 
by the cheesecake, too.</i>

00:17:45.390 --> 00:17:46.410
So good!

00:17:46.940 --> 00:17:49.540
<i>I'll never get tired of eating this!</i>

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:53.930
<i>The other two are good, too, 
but the souffle is still the best!</i>

00:17:56.400 --> 00:17:58.220
Whew, I'm stuffed.

00:17:58.570 --> 00:18:01.470
We just kept ordering more plates.

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:02.970
It was good, though, right?

00:18:03.260 --> 00:18:07.390
I've never had anything that good before.

00:18:07.390 --> 00:18:08.730
Nor have I.

00:18:08.730 --> 00:18:12.730
Right?! You'd better not call 
it "just a dessert" anymore!

00:18:13.020 --> 00:18:14.470
Oh, that's right.

00:18:14.470 --> 00:18:19.150
Alicia, don't you think this is a good 
time to talk to Hilda about that matter?

00:18:19.150 --> 00:18:20.600
Oh, yeah.

00:18:20.600 --> 00:18:22.740
What matter?

00:18:23.190 --> 00:18:24.990
Wanna team up with us?

00:18:24.990 --> 00:18:28.870
Team up? You mean for work?

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:31.230
Yes. If the three of us are a team,

00:18:31.230 --> 00:18:34.250
we can accept more challenging 
jobs than we do now.

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:36.150
And even if we divide up our earnings,

00:18:36.150 --> 00:18:40.510
we should still earn more than 
we do working individually.

00:18:42.160 --> 00:18:44.260
I see...

00:18:45.690 --> 00:18:47.410
Sounds like fun.

00:18:47.410 --> 00:18:49.300
I'll take you up on that.

00:18:58.230 --> 00:18:59.150
Crap!

00:18:59.150 --> 00:18:59.890
Duck!

00:19:02.340 --> 00:19:03.450
Thanks!

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:05.950
I'll back you up! Keep moving!

00:19:05.950 --> 00:19:07.450
I appreciate that!

00:19:23.020 --> 00:19:26.310
Man, that job we took last 
time was awesome, huh?

00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:30.350
Yes. The treasure that the goblins 
had been hiding was in their nest...

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:33.060
And we got paid a fortune on top of that!

00:19:33.060 --> 00:19:36.570
But none of us could have 
completed that task alone.

00:19:40.450 --> 00:19:44.350
The three of us can handle any job!

00:19:44.350 --> 00:19:45.690
You're right.

00:19:45.690 --> 00:19:47.200
Agreed.

00:19:47.200 --> 00:19:49.250
All right! Today we feast!

00:19:48.310 --> 00:19:50.960
<b>Western Restaurant Nekoya</b>

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:49.940
Yeah!

00:19:49.940 --> 00:19:50.960
Yes!

00:19:53.260 --> 00:19:54.710
Welcome.

00:19:55.030 --> 00:19:56.790
Please sit wherever you'd like.

00:19:57.770 --> 00:19:58.710
All right!

00:19:58.710 --> 00:20:01.200
I'm getting the three types of cheesecake.

00:20:01.530 --> 00:20:03.090
You're both okay with that, right?

00:20:03.090 --> 00:20:08.330
Nah, I'm just gonna eat a 
bunch of my favorite type.

00:20:08.330 --> 00:20:09.720
That's a good idea.

00:20:09.720 --> 00:20:12.090
Then I guess I'll do that, too.

00:20:12.430 --> 00:20:13.980
We're ready to order!

00:20:14.800 --> 00:20:18.480
Thank you for waiting. What can I get you?

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:20.280
One souffle cheesecake!

00:20:20.280 --> 00:20:21.840
Baked cheesecake for me!

00:20:21.840 --> 00:20:24.360
I'd like the rare cheesecake, please.

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:26.120
Huh?

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:31.200
But the best one is the souffle cheesecake 
that falls apart in your mouth!

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:32.310
What?!

00:20:32.310 --> 00:20:36.210
It's obviously the heavy, 
dense baked cheesecake!

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:38.400
What are you talking about?

00:20:38.400 --> 00:20:42.720
The best one is the rare cheesecake 
that feels as smooth as silk!

00:20:43.960 --> 00:20:45.280
Souffle!

00:20:45.280 --> 00:20:46.490
Baked!

00:20:46.490 --> 00:20:47.720
Rare!

00:20:51.540 --> 00:20:52.540
You wanna fight?!

00:20:52.540 --> 00:20:53.670
Anytime!

00:20:53.670 --> 00:20:54.810
I won't lose!

00:21:02.810 --> 00:21:03.590
Huh?

00:21:03.590 --> 00:21:05.060
What just happened?

00:21:05.060 --> 00:21:07.280
I didn't see anything...

00:21:09.000 --> 00:21:11.310
Fighting is not permitted here.

00:21:11.310 --> 00:21:15.500
I will hold onto these weapons 
until you are ready to leave.

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:21.380
There will not be a next time.

00:21:21.380 --> 00:21:22.420
Yes, ma'am!

00:21:23.300 --> 00:21:25.000
Now, if you'll excuse me.

00:21:26.910 --> 00:21:29.570
Um... Is everything all right?

00:21:29.570 --> 00:21:33.300
Yeah... Sorry for the trouble, Aletta.

00:21:33.300 --> 00:21:34.640
Yeah, sorry.

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:36.890
I sincerely apologize.

00:21:36.890 --> 00:21:39.930
I'll bring your cheesecake right away.

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:46.150
As soon as we leave here, we'll settle 
once and for all which cheesecake is best!

00:21:46.150 --> 00:21:47.370
Fine by me!

00:21:47.370 --> 00:21:49.160
I won't lose!

00:21:53.240 --> 00:21:54.660
Why do you have those?!

00:21:55.020 --> 00:21:57.510
I'm holding onto them for our customers.

00:22:02.110 --> 00:22:03.770
I... I see.

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:42.020
<i>Macaroni Gratin</i>

00:23:42.020 --> 00:23:50.250
<i>Fruit Jelly</i>
